METHODOLOGY ATTRIBUTION:

This software implements trading patterns and methodologies developed and
taught by Al Brooks. The H2 (High 2) and L2 (Low 2) pullback patterns are
based on his price action trading approach as described in his books and
trading course.

References:
- Brooks Trading Course: https://www.brookstradingcourse.com/
- "Reading Price Charts Bar by Bar" by Al Brooks
- "Trading Price Action Trends" by Al Brooks
- "Trading Price Action Reversals" by Al Brooks

This software is an independent implementation and is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or connected to Al Brooks or the Brooks Trading Course.
